e="docdb" status="new" lang="FR">PROCEDE ET DISPOSITIF PERMETTANT D'ACCROITRE LE DIAMETRE D'UN TUBE METALLIQUE</invention-title><citations><patent-citations><patcit ucid="JP-59130641-A"  status="new"><document-id status="new"  format="epo"><country>JP</country> <doc-number>59130641</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A"  name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit> <patcit ucid="JP-6065423-B" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country> <doc-number>6065423</doc-number> <kind>B</kind></document-id><sources><source category="X" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>IURA CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>IURA TADASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MORI KAZUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMAMOTO KEIJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IURA CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IURA, TADASHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MORI, KAZUKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMAMOTO, KEIJI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>IURA TADASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MORI KAZUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMAMOTO KEIJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IURA, TADASHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MORI, KAZUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMAMOTO, KEIJI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A device for increasing the diameter of a metal shaft material, comprising a drive rotating part (4) and a driven rotating part (6) opposed to each other at a specified interval, a shaft material holding part provided at each rotating part, a driving means (5) rotating the drive rotating part, a pressurizing means (8) pressing the shaft material held by the holding part in axial direction, an eccentric means (7) tilting the axis of the shaft material, whereby a linear metal shaft material or a metal tube, as a work, is gripped, at an appropriate interval D, by the pair of rotatably holding parts opposed to each other, and an axial rotation is given to the work and at least one of the rotatably holding bodies is moved in the direction to move toward the other holding body so as to return the bending for straightening the work after a collar-shaped increased diameter part has been reformed.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Dispositif permettant d'accroître le diamètre d'un tube métallique, qui comprend un élément rotatif d'entraînement (4) et un élément rotatif entraîné (6) opposés, séparés d'une certaine distance; un élément support de tube, disposé sur chaque élément rotatif; un élément d'entraînement (5) faisant tourner l'élément rotatif d'entraînement; un moyen de compression (8), qui presse le tube porté par l'élément support en direction axiale; et un élément excentrique (7), qui incline l'axe du tube. Un tube métallique linéaire ou un tuyau métallique, constituant la pièce à travailler, est saisi, à une distance D appropriée, par la paire d'éléments supports opposés; une rotation axiale est imprimée à la pièce; et au moins l'un des corps supports rotatifs est rapproché de l'autre de façon à inverser la coudure et ainsi à redresser la pièce une fois que la partie à diamètre augmenté, en forme de collier, a été formée.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>